'' tiko c2t: a record left as a TODO declares nothing, so a pointer to it later is the record's own name behind the hidden alias -- not its typedef's, which nothing declares (libssh2's LIBSSH2_POLLFD, TKO0808).
'' Everything after the clang line is asserted byte for byte; the tiko and clang versions
'' in the banner depend on the host, so only the lines around them are.
'' TEST: cli
'' CLEAN: build/.c2t/refuseduse
'' ARGS: c2t tests/c2t/src/refuseduse.h --verify -o build/.c2t/refuseduse/refuseduse.ti
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 2
